      <description>Deputies were dispatched to a rural part of Cachagua Road around 6:45 p.m. on Jan. 29, after people walking in the area found what appeared to be a human skull, along with other remains. A press release states that deputies confirmed the discovery, then secured the scene and turned it over to the coroner division.</description>
